Save id with your order and send the customer to invoice_url. The checkout page shows the coins your store accepts. When the customer picks one, the invoice gets its address (your wallet's main address, with a unique amount for this invoice), and the price is fixed in that coin until the invoice expires (default 30 minutes, and at least 15 minutes after the coin is chosen).
If the request times out and you do not know whether it worked, send it again with the same idempotencyKey (signed again, at least one second later): you get the first invoice back instead of a second one.

